    "bolero": {"title":"Bolero","kind":"genre","why":"Havana 1948, and the article's own first line says it is about the CUBAN genre of song; the Spanish dance is at Bolero (Spanish dance) and Ravel is at Boléro. This is the rare case where the bare word is already the right one."},
    "mambo": {"title":"Mambo_(music)","kind":"genre","why":"Mexico City 1950 is Perez Prado's own address; the bare `Mambo` is a disambiguation."},
