    "coldwave": {"title":"Cold_wave_(music)","kind":"genre","why":"Rennes 1979 is Dantzig Twist; the article is the European post-punk sub-genre — late 1970s France, Poland and Belgium in its own lead. Not Cold wave, the weather article, and not the American coldwave its hatnote points at (a 1990s industrial-metal scene)."},
