    "witchhouse": {"title":"Witch_house","kind":"genre","why":"Traverse City 2010 is Salem's King Night; the article is the genre (the electronic microgenre, its own hatnote separating other witch houses), chopped and screwed first in its stylistic origins. The label follows the named record; the article's own scene dating (c. 2006-2007) is in the row's comment."},
