    "photoplay": {"title":"John_Stepan_Zamecnik","kind":"artist","why":"Cleveland 1913 is Zamecnik's Sam Fox Moving Picture Music vol. 1, and the article is its composer — 'best known for the photoplay music he composed for use during silent films', the lead's own words. `Photoplay music` exists but fails this file's own lead-paragraph guard; the artist link is the Kinks precedent."},
